 the following equation:\n\n$$\n{180}^{∘}\\cdot (n-2)=1\\,{260}^{∘}\n$$\n\nNow, we solve for $n,$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{180}^{∘}\\cdot (n-2) & =1\\,{260}^{∘} \\\\ n-2 & =\\frac{1\\,{260}^{∘}}{{180}^{∘}} \\\\ n-2 & =7 \\\\ n & =9\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the polygon has $n=9$ sides (so it is a nonagon)." #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186571431 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186571374 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186571431 #edb/ref 1069 "q-4310" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186571431 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186571431 #edb/ref 1071 "![](images/fc/fc485a3c47295e08c917d1c9a2e90df0a0d6eaa931f4df23e17700da1536ca6e.png)\n\nIn the quadrilateral $OMNP$ shown above, find the measure of $∠N.$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186571431 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "9e56717a-c5ad-51b8-ae63-5cc496ab485e" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186571431 #edb/ref 1074 "A quadrilateral has $n=4$ sides. Therefore, the sum of the interior angles of a quadrilateral must be \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{180}^{∘}\\cdot (n-2) & ={180}^{∘}\\cdot (4-2) \\\\  & ={180}^{∘}\\cdot 2 \\\\  & ={360}^{∘}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nAdding up the internal angles and solving for $x,$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}m∠M+m∠N+m∠P+m∠O & ={360}^{∘} \\\\ {104}^{∘}+(10x-{4}^{∘})+{104}^{∘}+{76}^{∘} & ={360}^{∘} \\\\ 10x+{280}^{∘} & ={360}^{∘} \\\\ 10x & ={80}^{∘} \\\\ x & ={8}^{∘}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}m∠N & =10x-{4}^{∘} \\\\  & =10({8}^{∘})-{4}^{∘} \\\\  & ={76}^{∘}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186571456 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "000349e2-1e18-52dc-948a-61a295c5ca01" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186571456 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186571389 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186571462 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186571456 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186571462 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "168198c9-67f3-5f0f-8907-74beb26be266" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186571462 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186571431 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186571490 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186571462 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186571490 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "7983dc6b-c0cf-5e72-baec-ade88db8ba03" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186571490 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186106315 #edb/ref 17592186045417]}
